WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.598
Why paediatric arrest may differ.

00:00:02.598 --> 00:00:16.772
The 2022 manual states that paediatric out-of-hospital arrest is usually non-cardiac and most cases begin with a non-shockable rhythm, so ventilation and oxygenation are important.

00:00:16.772 --> 00:00:26.378
It also reports shockable initial rhythms in about 5–19% of cases, particularly among school-age children and adolescents.
